    "project_purpose": "Mu Digital is a real-world asset (RWA) protocol focused on Asia-based fixed income and private credit yield products. Its token structure includes AZND as the senior tranche and muBOND as the junior or first-loss tranche; staking, rewards, treasury, and related contracts should be treated as supporting infrastructure rather than the primary product unless separately documented.",
